  "Content": "The active Blazor shell uses a narrower 164px navigation drawer with Pages and Chat nav items. Memory and page workbench panes now use contained scrolling to avoid hidden detail content. Tag/status/link chips share the same small radius and inline-flex vertical centering. Local file source-link chips copy on click and Ctrl\u002BClick asks VarResolver to open the resolved local file with the OS default app after source-root validation and SourceLinks:AllowOpenWithDefaultApp checks.",
